{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05740","headline":"同皇甫兵曹天官寺浴室新成招友人赏会 · 寇坦","name":"同皇甫兵曹天官寺浴室新成招友人赏会","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"温室欢初就，兰交托胜因。\n共听无漏法，兼濯有爲尘。\n水洁三空性，香沾四大身。\n清心多善友，颂德慰同人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寇坦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}